<title>USA: Cisco Systems Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cisco Systems Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN JOSE, Calif., Nov 5 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.26		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net		 180,942		  181,387</p>
<p> Revs		1,434,826		798,291</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary682,918		  652,174</p>
<p>NOTE:</p>
<p>The net income per share and number of shares used in the per-share calculation for all periods presented reflect the two-for-one stock split which was effective February 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Latest Q1 net income includes an after-tax charge of $174.6 million or $0.26 per share as a writeoff of in-process R&amp;D, and a pre-tax gain of $55.1 million or $0.05 per share from the sale of a portion of a minority stock investment.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income in the latest first quarter, excluding those items, was $0.47 per chare.</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
</text>
